==Finnish==

===Etymology===
A {{etyl|gem|fi}} loan, compare {{proto|Germanic|aldōn|lang=}} (whence eg. Norwegian {{term|olda|lang=no}}). The ending has probably been modified to {{term|-as|lang=fi}} by analogy with other Germanic loans (such as {{term|valas|lang=fi}}). Karelian {{term|allaš||trough|lang=krl}} is of the same origin.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈɑlːɑs]}}
* {{rhymes|lang=fi|ɑlːɑs}}
* {{hyphenation|al|las}}

